<title>USA: First Lancaster sets semi-annual dividend.</title>
<headline>First Lancaster sets semi-annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Ky. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Lancaster Bancshares Inc said Monday its board authorized payment of a semi-annual cash dividend of $0.25 per share.</p>
<p>The first dividend will be paid on July 30 to stockholders of record on July 18, 1997.  Thereafter, the record date for subsequent dividends will be the third Friday in January and July of each year, it said.</p>
